A markdown tree read with its frontend's block schemas gets the search text the editor's save would write, so pages deployed from markdown are found by the words in every block, not only Text blocks. Two changes for a site deployed from markdown: set `CONTENT_SCHEMAS` for the mock API, which now refuses to export markdown without it; and drop `plaintext="${…/text}"` from your Text-block prototypes. Markdown no longer carries `plaintext`, and a prototype that makes it, or `searchableText`, is refused.
